  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the academy Gu storage room, Fang Yuan finds a Yellow Camel Longhorn Beetle Gu after passing a Brute Force Longhorn Beetle Gu. He judges it not compatible with him and walks on. The room holds only one. After he leaves, Gu Yue Mo Chen enters, sees that sole specimen still there, and takes it away.",
        "chapters": [
          62
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_brute_force_longhorn_beetle_gu",
          "char_gu_yue_mo_chen"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Gu Yue Bo later says Gu Yue Mo Bei chose the Yellow Camel Longhorn Beetle, which grants stamina and lets him sustain battle.",
        "chapters": [
          63
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_bo",
          "char_gu_yue_mo_bei"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On the year-end arena, Gu Yue Mo Bei fights Gu Yue Jin Zhu until her stamina fails and she surrenders, while he is not even fazed. Below the stage, Fang Yuan reads an increasing endurance Gu and names Yellow Camel Longhorn Beetle Gu as the probable worm.",
        "chapters": [
          82
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
